-- =====================================================================
-- BRAVOTOOLS DEMO SEED — "Sivysta UAB"
-- Deterministic demo data for local development (supabase db reset).
-- Runs after 0001_initial_schema.sql (plan_limits already seeded there).
--
-- Fixed UUID scheme (4th group = entity kind, tail = ordinal):
--   0000 org        0001 users      0002 external persons
--   0003 locations  0004 tools      0005 vendors
--   0006 tool categories            0007 tool components
--   0008 tool movements             0009 handover acts
--   0010 materials  0011 aliases    0012 material packages
--   0013 vehicles   0014 orders     0015 order items
--   0016 delivery issues            0017 vendor invoices
--   0018 vendor invoice lines       0019 reservations
--   0020 recharge invoices          0021 recharge lines
--   0022 tool repairs
--
-- All time-sensitive story dates are relative to now()/current_date so the
-- demo story (overdue rental, upcoming return, future reservations) always
-- holds regardless of when the reset runs.
-- =====================================================================

